<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Prague Guide: 25 Highlights &amp; Hidden Gems – Charles Bridge, Gardens, Vyšehrad – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Charles Bridge (Karlův most)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at 7 am or after dark. By day the bridge is mainly worth it as a way across – take photos early or late. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>14.41015,50.08663,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Old Town Square &amp; the Astronomical Clock (Orloj)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the morning or late in the evening when the tour groups are gone. Midday and on the hour the square is at its fullest. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>14.42071,50.08698,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Lesser Town: Nerudova, Lennon Wall &amp; Kampa</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Walk up Nerudova in the morning and return via Kampa after the castle – that way you get the quiet corners before they fill up. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>14.40681,50.08624,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Josefov – the Jewish Quarter</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Allow at least 2–3 hours and book online in high season – the cemetery is quietest in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>14.4181,50.08975,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Petřín: lookout tower, rose garden &amp; Hunger Wall</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the funicular up and walk back down – it saves energy and you see the Lesser Town from above. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>14.39493,50.08166,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Dancing House (Tančící dům)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the late afternoon for light on the river and the castle silhouette behind. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>14.41417,50.07543,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Vrtba Garden (Vrtbovská zahrada)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · The earlier the quieter – right after opening you often have the terraces almost to yourself. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>14.40248,50.08649,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Wallenstein Garden (Valdštejnská zahrada)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · The entrance is by Malostranská metro station (line A). In summer there are sometimes free concerts, and in high season the Senate palace is open on Saturdays. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>14.40643,50.09016,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. The quiet way up through the Stag Moat (Jelení příkop)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · The Golden Lane inside the castle is free in the late afternoon (from 4 pm, in summer from 5 pm). Check the current rules on site. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>14.40279,50.09221,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Prague Castle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Up via Nerudova street, down through the Stag Moat – that way you never walk a stretch twice. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>14.40052,50.09081,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Franciscan Garden (Františkánská zahrada)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Right in front of it on Jungmann Square stands the famous Cubist street lamp. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>14.42393,50.08215,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>14. Letná Park &amp; the Metronome</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o14</description><Point><coordinates>14.41414,50.0964,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>15. Letenské sady beer garden</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Bring cash in koruna – some stands do not take cards. The way up is a bit steep, and in the evening it is better not to walk back through the park alone. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o15</description><Point><coordinates>14.42567,50.09598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>16. Žižkov Television Tower</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine the visit with an evening in Žižkov or Vinohrady, where there are plenty of pubs and cafés. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o16</description><Point><coordinates>14.45106,50.08102,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>17. Vyšehrad Cemetery and Slavín</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · The entrance is to the left of the Church of Saints Peter and Paul. A list of names at the entrance shows where the famous graves are. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o17</description><Point><coordinates>14.41795,50.06465,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>18. Vyšehrad Fortress</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o18</description><Point><coordinates>14.41945,50.06421,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>19. DOX Centre for Contemporary Art</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · The surrounding neighbourhood has plenty of cafés and studios – good for a calm afternoon. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o19</description><Point><coordinates>14.44755,50.10679,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>21. Café Savoy</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Reserve ahead at weekends. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o21</description><Point><coordinates>14.40722,50.08093,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>22. Havelská Koruna</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o22</description><Point><coordinates>14.42166,50.08553,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>23. Manifesto Market Anděl</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/prague/#o23</description><Point><coordinates>14.40413,50.06935,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
